[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4020.95, "timestamp": "01:07:00", "text": "1.37,000～47,000%というのは、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4022.009, "timestamp": "01:07:02", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/ygF1XpGUMMjk8gSDrI2wCxUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/ygF1XpGUMMjk8gSDrI2wCx"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4023.19, "timestamp": "01:07:03", "text": "かなりの金額です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4026.309, "timestamp": "01:07:06", "text": "そのお金があれば、iPhoneもあれも買えるよ。 だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4041.829, "timestamp": "01:07:21", "text": "インド人にとって手頃な価格で依頼を受けてくれるアーティストやクリエイターがあまりいないので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4045.19, "timestamp": "01:07:25", "text": "難しくなると思いますが、ほとんどの人は当然、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4047.43, "timestamp": "01:07:27", "text": "標準価格である米ドルを選ぶでしょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4051.43, "timestamp": "01:07:31", "text": "例えば、最近のVroモデルは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4055.43, "timestamp": "01:07:35", "text": "500以上です。 芸術作品自体は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4057.67, "timestamp": "01:07:37", "text": "500以上です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4060.15, "timestamp": "01:07:40", "text": "プレミアムグレードのアートをお求めの場合は、すべて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4063.27, "timestamp": "01:07:43", "text": "500に加えてアート代として1,000～2,000が加算されます。 リギングの場合"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4067.589, "timestamp": "01:07:47", "text": "、開始価格は2,000ドルから3,000ドルくらいで、それに"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4069.17, "timestamp": "01:07:49", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yaaa I have the money part covered but I want to go about this the smart and steady way and learn first... jumping in blind is scary and dumb... "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4071.19, "timestamp": "01:07:51", "text": "2,000ドルに加えて、